            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Transmission went through!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Captain? Do you copy?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "I'm here! It's me! What's your status?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Most of us are fine. We're trapped under this building at the moment, but we found an access hatch."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "We'll regroup with you if we find another exit."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "We disabled the restart function. Rest assured, we've got a very defensible position. Make your way here and you won't have to worry about getting caught flat-footed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "But..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Bluishsilver, she's..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Gah!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "...No, no, Rosmontis! Wait!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Focus on the mission... don't come for us! You promised us before we set out!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "But!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Keep your promise! We wouldn't have followed you into Chernobog without it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Remember our talk back when we joined your team?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Listen to me, Rosmontis... we talked about how elite operators and their teams are all different."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "You can do so much. You Arts are so strong. There's not much we can do for you in a fight."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "But when you can't handle the burden, we'll share it with you. Just like Amiya and the other elite operators."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "But you're my team!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Calm down!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Bluishsilver's last wish..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Was that we help you grow as a warrior, not a soldier, and not a weapon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Captain, you get your job done. We'll make it out of here safe."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Listen, Rosmontis. This might be hard to do. But it's what Bluishsilver wanted."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "'You're not just an elite operator, you're Rosmontis. We all love you, not just your team, but Rhodes Island and the Infected, everyone who hates loss and destruction... we all love you.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "So, Captain, 'Think about what 'Rosmontis' would do, okay?'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "Over and out. Tell Amiya hi for us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Don't leave me. Please come back."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember",
        "text": "We will."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$transmission",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "They cut the transmission."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "What's the situation?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Oh, Amiya. We lost one member of the engineering team, but the rest are safe for now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Rosmontis... We need a little more firepower. The guerrilla mortar team needs supplies. We'll ambush them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Are you okay?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Amiya, after Ace died, what did you think?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Oh!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "You don't have to tell me if you don't want to. But I want to know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Sorry, I don't want to think too much about it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "You want to run away too?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "No, it's just not the time to face up to it. Tears are for the end, when it's all over."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I only remember the very end, I was thinking..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "That I didn't want to let him, or any of our Rhodes Island operators, die in vain."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Good."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Recon Operator, tell me where. I'm going."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Reunion is totally out of control. Watch yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Because we're their enemy?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Because everything is their enemy. Without an enemy to fight, sometimes people make their own."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
