    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "What are you worried about? Vanguard group, attack!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Sniper group, fall back!;Defender operators, cover them!;Casters, cease fire!",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sniper Operator",
        "text": "Roger! Form up and reload!"
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Defender Operator",
        "text": "Roger! Hold fast! Don't let them cut off the corridor!"
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Caster Operator",
        "text": "Stop casting! Watch for friendly fire!"
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_091"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Herdified Sarkaz Warrior",
        "text": "No further! Too scary."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Herdified Sarkaz Warrior",
        "text": "Don't hit! Pain! Pain everywhere."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "That's an unpleasant infection symptom."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "They are no longer human.;......;More disturbing than the Infected mutants in Lungmen.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "If you want to ask if I worry about Rosmontis, Amiya, and their teams..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I have to confess, there's no use worrying."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We settled on the plan, and it all runs on a predesigned track. If you squeeze onto someone else's rail, you'll just end up derailing two trains."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "The herd doesn't look like it's pushing up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Stay focused! We want to pass through, not wipe them out!",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Clear them in waves. We don't have the capacity to take on an entire battlefield."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "I'm worried about Amiya.;I'm worried about Rosmontis.;I'm worried about the operation.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Amiya is a mature leader and an excellent fighter. She knows the team, the operation, and our objectives."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Rosmontis is a powerhouse and the elite operator best supported by her team. She clears her mission objectives cleanly and decisively, as long as the operation utilizes her properly."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Chernobog is in the midst of a raging storm, and given the circumstances there's not much worrying about the situation can accomplish."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "The most important thing we can do for them is accomplish our own team's strategic objectives."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "That's it?! ;......;Isn't that a little cold?",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "background",
        "params": {
            "image": "bg_infirmary",
            "screenadapt": "coverall"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_095"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pith",
        "text": "I don't think so."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "She's through all seven training segments and passed every test given to her. There were three in which she showed particular promise."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_095"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pith",
        "text": "I have no faith in casters like this. Kalt'sit, I pride myself on my skill with Arts, and I hope to help others with it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pith",
        "text": "That's not what Rosmontis is. Her Originium Arts are not those that serve to benefit mankind."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I want her to fight, but for one consideration."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "If Rosmontis spent her whole life in the greenhouse, her outburst once reality shatters her beautiful world would be catastrophic."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_095"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pith",
        "text": "If you can't do it, I will."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Pith!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_095"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pith",
        "text": "You and Amiya have too much faith in the future. One misstep and someone else's future is gone forever."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Before we make a judgment like that, we have to at least try."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_095"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pith",
        "text": "I'm worried about a future that's beyond saving."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "For now, I'll have her serve as an elite operator. Not in the future, but now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Right now, we teach her, polish her, forge her strength into shape, hold her to the highest standards, and watch her stand firm in the face of Catastrophe."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Until there is nothing in the world that can shake her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Only then will she be free of the terrible fate the Columbians set out for her. Only then can she lead her own life."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "That is my goal."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_095"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pith",
        "text": "I knew you'd say something like that, Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pith",
        "text": "But who's responsible for her?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I need you to work with me. I need the elite operators on this together."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "And I promise you, I stake my life on it. We will see this through."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
